Emission Tomography and the Associated Risk of Clinical Progression of Mild Cognitive
Impairment and Alzheimer Disease</article-title><subtitle>Results From 2 Phase III Clinical Trials</subtitle><alt-title alt-title-type="headline">Aggregated Tau and the Associated Risk of Clinical
Progression</alt-title><alt-title alt-title-type="running-head">Aggregated Tau and the Associated Risk of Clinical
